Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value PHY (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value VRF (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^\s*\*down:.*$$
  ^\s*\(s\):.*$$
  ^\s*Interface\s+Physical\s+Protocol\s+IP\s+address/Mask\s+VPN\s+instance\s+Description\s*$$ -> Records
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$

Records
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${PHY}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${VRF}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$
